III. Soft iron retains magnetism more than steel.', null, '["I only","II and III only","I and II only","I, II and III."]', 2, 'An electromagnet must switch on and off easily. Soft iron magnetizes and demagnetizes readily; steel retains its magnetism.', true, '2026-10-12 19:15:38.133', '2026-10-12 19:15:38.133', null, null, null, 'Which of the following correctly explain(s) why soft iron is preferred to steel in electromagnets?<br>I. Soft iron is more readily magnetized than steel.<br>II. Soft iron is more readily demagnetized than steel.<br>III. Soft iron retains magnetism more than steel.', '["I only","II and III only","I and II only","I, II and III."]', 'An electromagnet must switch on and off easily. Soft iron magnetizes and demagnetizes readily; steel retains its magnetism.', '{"bold":[],"italic":[],"underline":[],"fillBlanks":[]}');
I. Evaporation occurs at all temperatures while boiling occurs at a fixed temperature for a given pressure.
II. Evaporation is a surface phenomenon while boiling is an interior phenomenon.
III. Evaporation is affected by surface area while boiling is not.', null, '["I and II only","I and III only","II and III only","I, II and III."]', 3, 'All three statements correctly describe differences between evaporation and boiling.', true, '2026-10-12 19:15:41.469', '2026-10-12 19:15:41.469', null, null, null, 'Which of the following statements give the <b>TRUE</b> differences between evaporation and boiling?<br>I. Evaporation occurs at all temperatures while boiling occurs at a fixed temperature for a given pressure.<br>II. Evaporation is a surface phenomenon while boiling is an interior phenomenon.<br>III. Evaporation is affected by surface area while boiling is not.', '["I and II only","I and III only","II and III only","I, II and III."]', 'All three statements correctly describe differences between evaporation and boiling.', '{"bold":["TRUE"],"italic":[],"underline":[],"fillBlanks":[]}');
